<title>USA: Meridian SD 2, Idaho, yields 5.85 pct in 2006.</title>
<headline>Meridian SD 2, Idaho, yields 5.85 pct in 2006.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seattle-Northwest Securities Corp said it repric ed $8.895 million of Ada and Canyon Counties Joint School District 2 (Meridian), Idaho with a top yield of 4.85 percent in 2006.</p>
</text>
